urce":"A filigree of silver set with many small jewels, this diadem seems radiant - ethereal almost. But its touch seems to freeze your skin and brings wild thoughts to your mind. You want to drop it, throw it away, and yet you cannot resist thinking of what powers it might bring you.\nIs this temptation a weak will on your part, or some domination from the artifact itself...?","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个镶嵌有很多珠宝的银制艺术品，这顶王冠看起来光芒四射而又美丽优雅。但是当你碰到它时，你感到你的皮肤都要冻僵了，许多狂暴的意识涌向你的大脑。你想丢弃它，扔掉它，但是你最终无法抗拒它能带给你的力量。\n是你的意志太薄弱，还是这件神器支配了你？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cd88ca519ca3a64f3ccc929306e0b2cc87902a369ef3daae5019b9390d18c57a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1c277d1c88b4b074296c6423002cbbf3bb9c1341a383e0d7ec49ec8da44cc9be","logical_entry_identity":"c622ac97393366116ed0a0b03cd67deb09b72061b2cb857bba58b1b5dad30aad","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Countering melee attacks: Has a %d%% chance to get an automatic counter attack when avoiding a melee attack. (%0.1f counters remaining)","source_tag":"tformat","target":"反击近战攻击：有 %d%% 几率在闪避近战攻击后反击对方。（剩余次数 %0.1f）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"256c21ec9c914f6d3996c0fe39661fc0d6778873b22e8e4ec040a6c0f98868b5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1c2979526f9df687a5b9e07f8ae8a8a48de873b0a185a55471d17261d2b0ff2d","logical_entry_identity":"b3ed4829955dc8565df74137288d65022207213cd8cf8aa12695220d9257ab04","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your wife has been turned into a giant, bloated form that towers above you. Mucus and slime ooze from every orifice, dripping onto the floor. The sight and the smell make you retch.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你的妻子变成了一只铁塔般的浮肿怪物。黏液和粘稠的液体从每个孔洞向外渗出，不断滴落在地板上。此情此景使你异常反胃。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b395a04986e86899acc9ff062db993442e68e728895b39033c8475764be0ec87","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1c2e16614715753994b4041339010989cf294be547230ff68ea7baab858c685b","logical_entry_identity":"46fb7c8e1c79a219f4d0226e2e9c63a289d9145d0122d03a1