切，持续 20 回合。每次受影响的对象消耗资源（体力、法力、活力等）时，将会受到 %0.2f 点火焰伤害。\n\t\t同时，对方使用的技能的冷却时间延长 %d%% +1 个回合。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"045a3f00e462a94dbc5597bfd21c779f14df2cc9ed27d78cb382a814ec4fc59b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1cabed62eed0e8affba460b6c5ef3e2f52adb5a0436ac88b5cc761a62ea25005","logical_entry_identity":"bf9157669a8dad0248068b91a470d997c28e6fd8999479a852fbe01238aca948","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Use custom tileset","source_tag":"_t","target":"使用自定义贴图"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d0b1a3bfbaba48897fd294c8192a10e481068fdd022f26b874bf66406c86da55","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1cadde91fb765ec2defa70fa6d6c630e50ad83dfd2c2ff665a1d248df7259cd2","logical_entry_identity":"ab23bebb073f13834a7784230db1bc0345d2461de3e451d4ce5f9a96242d5d9b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Bloom Heal","source_tag":"talent name","target":"夏花之愈"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c4a002b1f4c7fece80b88fc21f5094766109b7f9bfba22423d74207201f7d86a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1cae78d6e7791e50e498a85ea6c845563b3b156269601beb5d3ddb8b003e4267","logical_entry_identity":"78dd78205189d02394d4b942b0d10e652ead610311f80d1b852ee7d7d69d4b7c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"orc telepathy","source_tag":"entity name","target":"感知兽人"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d14f0dd9460522025967273853d6fd73fa57a4d1873837145b1a04583fa7b3d1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1cb384dfa4db2aaf7c26d463c3db22a58fb42cd1b9115c912c1abdaf68eab89c","logical_entry_identity":"225d548e59ff66dd69a7e1ab8cee87ae28eba8dda8a6e78ac8448ad75a03dc60","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Have summoned at least 100 creatures. More permanent summons may count as more than 1.","source_tag":"_t","target":"曾召唤了 100 个以上的召唤生物。各种永久召唤物算作超过 1 个单位。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9bb4f831283e2da7a1dbdbd105a300d646df5eebf20d894edd760e73cb28418f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1cb5f62795bf5a7cdaa4fd161e1a5eb1f3c8edeac05d977a57abe3721f7f3bab","logical_entry_identity":"7b7b1705d0e5d28c111eb0b632e08f6c243256e63e65a1a4f15dffd4a1dd2228","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"snake","source_tag":"entity subtype","target":"蛇"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"553f5877009f3fae8d16246f648976913e01aa561e4e59e6ab6560a1ca0276df","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1cb80c3f41a077dc53b87306f150925a5f2187b5450d477779bff1cf0292145a","logical_entry_identity":"1d3029d69aaab21631acd33f18accb40dbc7432d7a27344cc0f92b6be70ac0c9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You cannot use Blunt Thrust without a staff weapon!","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你需要一把法杖来施展该技能！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7080e634e5624bb074274d90b58eebfdb18c7e4878686bb64d7c5c847717a2c8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1cb8a0c33c22635df07c3f6c52e284fac104f6088ed568bdb43b90a37f263091","logical_entry_identity":"9e15695efa9554b3daf1ef33fc43712bdbe1ce6518e87f68f7b904e51f5a25d2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You keep a special stash of %d throwing knives in your bandolier, which you can throw all at once at enemies within a radius %d cone, for %d%% damage each.\n\t\tEach target can be hit up to 5 times, if the number of knives exceeds the number of enemies.  Creatures block knives from hitting targets behind them.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"额外存储 %d 把飞刀，可以一次性扔出，每把飞刀对 %d 格锥形范围内的敌人造成 %d%% 伤害。\n\t\t如果飞刀数量多于敌人，每个目标最多被同时击中 5 次。飞刀无法穿透生物。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7baf298be6b02653df07867fd8474e92653c95af43a574740f5ab6458a357ed0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1cc3982a87de6ebed5f9986d72f5415d268becb16a52756712bcf8b9d12027ba","logical_entry_identity":"d6ce5c080b15461fb89cd5ec5d66877d71ea935b8ef09dcabf523060556565d1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"ladder back to %s","source_tag":"_t","target":"返回%s的楼梯"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"79247931dba46d26d3106bb4b92bf5f571726779edb8afe544fd986d617f4834","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1cc5d745cb4f7d9573ac7476982e8e248b3811ff264ac63ee3fcfd4944002b99","logical_entry_identity":"ab611793440c249e81f4494ac236ead24e515d5893e3731d78e29cfa3f90e266","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"orc","source_tag":"talent type","target":"兽人"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a89438ce69757a3c2256ca7583b9939f3a581d55603c2c6dc6f41950c5580b38","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1cc7291792e7ffa110b52980dd1cc358a0931ff6e7b12802b5b4a8ad17b71b8f","logical_entry_identity":"b2ca00d4be79429aea2e2efd794c8b64f28c9030a159d1a9c144d3f6a601e398","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A foul wind chills your bones as this ghastly figure approaches.","source_tag":"_t","target":"当这只可怕的生物靠近时，你感到脊背一阵发凉。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9ea3d7a720238a201e767a689eb1834296f4d0223d68e21284a16f8535caa279","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1cc8d3894bc12e724ad05f5dad6c1b52ddc926a3bb776b464fe69627988bd33e","logical_entry_identity":"88cbe5511ae907a66466ac7fdcc42ea2d19dd73f01dcf3bd3c93035e46e86c1b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Aha, I have found the accursed undead that plague this nefarious dungeon! The skeletal fool was thankfully no match for me! I suppose it helped that he had no arms...\n\nI've found myself an old shield that in spite of a few dents seems serviceable enough. Some of these rats are BIG, and giving them a strong bash with the shield helps to stop their poisonous bites before I get my sword to their necks. I also found a few gems - I may have to hunt round for more. Not out of any personal greed of course, but my noble quest requires that I gather resources to defeat the great evils in this land and back home!\n\nDiamonds are my favourite, so sparkly.","source_tag":"_t","target":"啊哈，我总算找到了占据这邪恶地牢的可憎不死族！谢天谢地，那个骷髅蠢货根本不是我的对手！不过我想，它没有双臂大概也帮了点忙……\n\n我在这找到了一面老旧的盾牌，它虽有几处凹痕但仍堪用。这里有些老鼠特别大，给它们一个强力的盾击能在我用剑切开它们脖子前阻止它们带毒的撕咬。\n我还发现了一些宝石——看来我得继续四处搜寻更多宝石。必须申明的是，这肯定不是出于任何贪念，只是因为我崇高的任务需要我收集更多的资源，好打败这里和故乡的强大邪恶势力！\n\n我最喜欢钻石了，一闪一闪亮晶晶～。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a7bb949f5dfc84e9c96ee47dbb38449ff08ca45fa5e2191a08f47bb7fbbabb25","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1cd0f787b8973ec4339d4dbd9db90e9511098462d6984526cc15eeea69b4f935","logical_entry_identity":"1351d554b6d26f4854ea41c493f9a0f48d3b84b48f4a14b2c75c4b36fe61816d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"bladed","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"刀刃"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"06ea9acd60706b6defbf706ea110c10dfa309353b5d273fb389fe9cda36fb223","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1cd349213c4c5cb65ed98670b2b622c42c2a6f06a12d1c339f30c434bc2e813b","logical_entry_identity":"539d2c518f732c3ae8b9f4309ce07d7dbe668e6b3204714df02070e29f37527d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"huge crack in the floor","source_tag":"entity name","target":"地面上的巨大裂缝"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}}